243
00:25:08.090 --> 00:25:10.765
Lava on sinu, Harald Trass.

244
00:34:07.550 --> 00:34:10.700
Järgmine sõna tuleb teie ette,
Annabel Soode.

245
00:34:29.110 --> 00:34:31.450
Fantastiline, fantastiline esitus,

246
00:34:31.550 --> 00:34:33.410
Brava.
Seda minu meelest on sinu puhul

247
00:34:33.510 --> 00:34:36.770
