olulised. Lava on sinu.

261
00:35:47.080 --> 00:35:49.430
Annabel Soode.

262
00:41:44.370 --> 00:41:47.510
Nii, nüüd on siis esimene hetk,
kus me palume oma kolm esimest

263
00:41:47.610 --> 00:41:50.369
