et palju õnne.

297
00:44:12.710 --> 00:44:21.330
Te olete ikka romantilised.
Ma sellele, kuidas öelda hetkel ja

298
00:44:21.330 --> 00:44:23.790
mis seal

299
00:44:23.890 --> 00:44:26.230
